00:06:09,668 --> 00:06:12,403
[Host] Quiz time. Three questions.

57
00:06:13,004 --> 00:06:20,348
[Slow] 日本は、初めての試合でどのチームと戦いましたか。

58
00:06:21,148 --> 00:06:25,540
[Host] Which team did Japan play in its first match? The Netherlands.

59
